#. module: account_statement_import_online_stripe
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_import_online_stripe.field_online_bank_statement_provider__stripe_foreign_currency
msgid ""
"For the payments made in a currency other than the one of the balance, keep "
"on the line the amount and the currency of the payment."
msgstr ""
"Per i pagamenti fatti in una valuta diversa da quella del saldo, conserva "
"sulla riga l'importo e la valuta del pagamento."

